      "title": "PM called on to act on communal grave revelations as NSW commits to urgent review",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/07/nsw-health-people-buried-unmarked-grave-minister-failings-families",
      "description": "<p>‘All deceased persons should be treated with dignity and respect, regardless of their financial circumstances,’ authorities say after Guardian Australia investigation</p><ul><li><p>Find more from the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/unmarked-graves\">Unmarked graves investigation</a> here</p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Anthony Albanese has been urged to use national cabinet to stop the use of unmarked communal graves to bury impoverished Australians and address failings that are leaving family and friends blindsided.</p><p>Guardian Australia’s revelations on Tuesday that unmarked, communal graves were being used, in some cases without notifying the families of the deceased, prompted widespread political condemnation on Tuesday, including from federal Liberal MPs, state Labor ministers, and the Greens.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/07/nsw-health-people-buried-unmarked-grave-minister-failings-families\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-06T14:00:17"
    },
    {
      "title": "Coalition’s migration plan risks breaching India free trade agreement and damaging economy, advocates warn",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/07/coalition-migration-policy-reaction-universities-students-economy-india-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Angus Taylor’s drastic cuts to graduate visas aim to end a citizenship pathway, but universities body says changes will make Australia less competitive</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/06/coalition-immigration-policy-angus-taylor-one-nation-labor-ntwnfb\">Coalition’s migration plan</a> risks breaching Australia’s free trade agreement with India, signed by the former Morrison government, allowing Indian students to stay and work for up to four years after completing their studies.</p><p>Angus Taylor on Tuesday announced plans to cut net overseas migration to 100,000 for the first two years of a Coalition government and up to 160,000 in year four, in a plan which would abolish temporary graduate visas, make major cuts to international student, bridging and temporary protection visas, and halve humanitarian places.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/07/coalition-migration-policy-reaction-universities-students-economy-india-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-06T14:00:16"
    },
    {
      "title": "Richard Morecroft, veteran ABC news presenter, dies age 70 after cancer diagnosis",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/oct/06/richard-morecroft-veteran-abc-news-presenter-dies-age-70-after-cancer-diagnosis",
      "description": "<p>Michael Rowland and Leigh Sales lead tributes to newsreader who read the ABC’s 7pm bulletin for 20 years</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Former ABC news presenter Richard Morecroft has died at the age of 70.</p><p>Morecroft presented ABC’s 7pm news bulletin for almost 20 years until 2002.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/oct/06/richard-morecroft-veteran-abc-news-presenter-dies-age-70-after-cancer-diagnosis\">Continue reading...</a>",
